    "body": "## Merge order\n\n- Based on `main`; no dependencies. Open PRs #415 to #421 do not touch `sp-reading-uuid`, so they merge in any order with this.\n\n## Problem\n\n- `sp-devonthink-insert-link` failed with `No DEVONthink record named arthur-2004-value-negat.pdf`.\n- Cause: the single-record lookup searched `name:KEY.pdf` and required the record name to equal `KEY.pdf` exactly.\n- DEVONthink often keeps the name without `.pdf`, so the lookup found nothing (the bulk refresh already handled this, the single lookup did not).\n- The lookup was also AppleScript (`search ... in root of database`), the style that failed with -1728 elsewhere.\n\n## Change\n\n- `sp-reading--lookup-script` is now JXA: searches `name:KEY`, accepts a record whose name (without `.pdf`, any case) or file name on disk equals KEY.\n- `sp-reading-uuid` falls back, on a miss, to one full `sp-reading-refresh` (path-based, as in #426) and looks again.\n- Still returns nil for a key that is truly absent, so the error message stays.\n- Doc: `sp-reading.org` (tangled to `sp-reading.el`); 3 new ERT tests, 3 existing ones updated.\n\n## What was verified\n\n- [x] Tests pass locally (12 in `sp-reading-test.el`, 14 in `sp-devonthink-test.el`); tangle check passes.\n- [ ] Not verified: the JXA `app.search` call and the `r.path()` match against real DEVONthink (no DEVONthink in the build environment).\n\n## Manual testing\n\n- [x] `M-x sp-reading-refresh`: message shows a non-zero count (if 0, run `M-x sp-reading-diagnose` and paste the buffer).\n- [x] Reload the module or restart Emacs so the cache is empty, open a litnote for `arthur-2004-value-negat` and run `M-x sp-devonthink-insert-link`: a `devonthink:UUID::PAGE` link is inserted, no error.\n- [x] `M-x eval-expression` `(sp-reading-uuid \"arthur-2004-value-negat\")` returns a UUID; running it again is instant (cached).\n- [x] `(sp-reading-uuid \"no-such-2000-key\")` returns nil and `sp-devonthink-insert-link` on it still says `No DEVONthink record named no-such-2000-key.pdf`.\n- [x] Click the inserted link: DEVONthink opens that PDF at the right page.\n- [x] If it still fails, paste the record's name and path as shown in DEVONthink (Get Info) for `arthur-2004-value-negat`.\n\n## Revert guide\n\n- `git revert` the single commit of this PR; nothing else depends on it.\n- Reverting restores the old exact-name AppleScript lookup (the original failure returns).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiDWYwkgX4eqm2SVoTC)_",
